# SocioMart Netlify Redirects & Proxies

# Block Netlify HUD / Badge injection script
/.netlify/scripts/hud*   /empty.js   200!

# Proxy all API requests to the live Render backend
/api/*          https://sociomart-demo.onrender.com/api/:splat          200!
/admin/login    https://sociomart-demo.onrender.com/admin/login          200!

